    <statement><p>(a) Find a vector-parametric equation 
<m>\vec{r}_1(t) = \langle x(t), y(t), z(t) \rangle</m>
for the shadow of the circular cylinder <m>x^2 + z^2 = 5</m> 
in the <m>xz</m>-plane.</p>
<p>Shadow: <m>\vec{r}_1(t) =</m> 
<fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0001"/>
for <m>0 \leq t \leq 2\pi</m>.</p>
<p>(b) Find a vector-parametric equation 
for intersection of the circular cylinder 
<m>x^2 + z^2 = 5</m> and the plane 
<m>2 x + 9 y + 6 z = 1</m>.</p>
<p>Intersection: <m>\vec{r}_2(t) =</m> 
<fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0002"/>
for <m>0 \leq t \leq 2\pi</m>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;\sqrt{5}\cos\mathopen{}\left(t\right),0,\sqrt{5}\sin\mathopen{}\left(t\right)\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;\sqrt{5}\cos\mathopen{}\left(t\right),\frac{1-2\sqrt{5}\cos\mathopen{}\left(t\right)-6\sqrt{5}\sin\mathopen{}\left(t\right)}{9},\sqrt{5}\sin\mathopen{}\left(t\right)\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
  </static>
